{"unit_id":"ZnFr60__dsh-lan-access-for-windows#card-zh","repo":"ZnFr60/dsh-lan-access-for-windows","commit":"de4ab84e1f99a6964b45b67117fc18f82b5e8100","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-access 是面向 DSH Web profile 的局域网访问插件，让手机浏览器也能连接电脑上的 DSH Web。它通过 bundle patch 将 webserver 绑定地址设为 0.0.0.0，并挂载运行时插件，在网页 HTML 的 head 中注入 crypto.randomUUID 兼容代码。注入代码仅在原生接口不可用时使用 getRandomValues 生成 UUID，插件还会在服务就绪后显示局域网 IPv4 访问地址。适合希望在同一局域网内用手机访问 DSH Web 的用户；需要 DSH web profile 和 Node.js 18 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:25-32","lib/index.js:27-53","lib/index.js:67-95"]}
{"unit_id":"ZnFr60__dsh-lan-access-for-windows#card-en","repo":"ZnFr60/dsh-lan-access-for-windows","commit":"de4ab84e1f99a6964b45b67117fc18f82b5e8100","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-lan-access lets a phone browser use DSH Web over the local network. Its web-profile bundle binds the server to all interfaces and adds a crypto.randomUUID shim for browsers missing that API. It prints the computer’s LAN address after startup. Requires the DSH web profile and Node.js 18+.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:25-32","lib/index.js:27-53","lib/index.js:67-95"]}
