{"unit_id":"ZnFr60__dsh-lan-access-for-windows#feature-1","repo":"ZnFr60/dsh-lan-access-for-windows","commit":"de4ab84e1f99a6964b45b67117fc18f82b5e8100","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-access 的功能「局域网网页访问」：将 webserver 绑定到所有网络接口，并保留 web 启动时配置的端口。安装在 web profile 后，手机可通过电脑的局域网地址打开 DSH Web。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:25-28"]}
{"unit_id":"ZnFr60__dsh-lan-access-for-windows#feature-2","repo":"ZnFr60/dsh-lan-access-for-windows","commit":"de4ab84e1f99a6964b45b67117fc18f82b5e8100","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-access 的功能「浏览器 UUID 兼容」：页面加载时注入 shim；若 crypto.randomUUID 不可用，则用 crypto.getRandomValues 生成 UUID v4，供手机浏览器使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:27-53","lib/index.js:67-72"]}
{"unit_id":"ZnFr60__dsh-lan-access-for-windows#feature-3","repo":"ZnFr60/dsh-lan-access-for-windows","commit":"de4ab84e1f99a6964b45b67117fc18f82b5e8100","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-access 的功能「显示访问地址」：web 服务就绪后读取机器的非内部 IPv4 地址和服务端口，并在控制台打印对应的 HTTP 局域网地址，方便手机浏览器连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:55-59","lib/index.js:82-95"]}
